| `make eval-live` `[read,cost]` | Sends every eval case to the configured model, under a call cap checked before any call, and writes the answers as candidate lines for a person to promote. | `make eval-live` | [`evals.live.model`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evals.live.max_calls`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`evals.live.model_options`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Spends model calls. Refuses a null model or a run larger than the cap (default `0`); exits `BACKEND_ABSENT` (11) when the backend is absent. Never edits the dataset. Not a `make verify` goal. | [README_run.md](../../evals/README_run.md) | always |
